{"id":"660421","name":"水煮龙利鱼","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/660421/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"龙利鱼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酸菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豌豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"番茄火锅底料","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金针菇切去底部一截，撕成小把清洗干净。","img":"images/660421/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豌豆适量、酸菜切丝。","img":"images/660421/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"龙利鱼解冻清洗沥去水。","img":"images/660421/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切成片。","img":"images/660421/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加盐、料酒、胡椒粉、姜丝、淀粉拌匀腌制10分钟。","img":"images/660421/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜苗切好备用。","img":"images/660421/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅冷油，放入蒜白和酸菜翻炒。","img":"images/660421/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量番茄火锅底料炒匀。","img":"images/660421/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加水，放入金针菇烧煮。","img":"images/660421/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入豌豆烧煮。","img":"images/660421/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蔬菜快煮熟时放入龙利鱼烧熟。","img":"images/660421/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入蒜苗，酌情加盐调味。","img":"images/660421/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/660421/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}